The assertions correctly verify both the bank account balance lookup and the main transaction query using the derived `stripe_financial_account_id`. Line 137 confirms the implementation queries `raw_data->>account` with the resolved account ID, which addresses the historical limitation where bank_transactions lacked a dedicated `bank_account_id` column (based on learnings).




